# MÓDULO QUEST #

### GET all quests
GET {{baseUrl}}/quest

### GET quest by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/quest/{{questId}}

### POST create quest
POST {{baseUrl}}/quest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Resgatar a princesa",
  "description": "Levar a princesa de volta ao castelo",
  "reward": 150.5
}

### GET quests by adventurer
GET {{baseUrl}}/quest/adventurer/{{adventurerId}}

### PATCH accept quest
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/quest/{{questId}}/adventurer/{{adventurerId}}

### PATCH complete quest
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/quest/{{questId}}/